	(gr_text "- load switch, active load protection\n  - Remove fuses\n  - Remove secondary load switch driver tied to active load \n    - consider ISO672x, ISO7710\n    - power from primary load switch driver or 5V ISO\n- general\n  - remove extraneous test points\n  - remove sectional led power and caps, use solder bridge at power source\n- power reg\n  - shrink 12V-5V buck inductor footprint\n- lockout control\n  - replace resistors for lockout control comparator with DAC53508 10-bit 8 channel DAC.\n  - shrink layout to single 3.3k pullup on open drain outputs"
